  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4907.01 Procedural Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4907.01 Procedural Hearings. Unless otherwise provided, all hearings conducted by the department shall be conducted in accordance with the department’s procedures for conducting hearings as set forth in Saf-C 200.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06",
